      "text": "  ",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790904961,
      "updated": 1790911975
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf0a810000000000f2398c",
      "text": "  ",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790904961,
      "updated": 1790911975
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf20ae0000000000435d37",
      "text": "      [ドットマリオ やられ.icon]",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790910639,
      "updated": 1790911975
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf24fe00000000002424e7",
      "text": "      [♫ https://dic.nicovideo.jp/mml_id/653]",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790911743,
      "updated": 1790913370
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf0c420000000000f23997",
      "text": "  なるほどね",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790905410,
      "updated": 1790911975
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf125400000000007c6c66",
      "text": "   [クッパ城]にすなーっ☝️[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790906966,
      "updated": 1790911975
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf264400000000002424ee",
      "text": "    マリオ追記ありがてぇ[KNo.804C.icon]",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790912076,
      "updated": 1790912076
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf0a5a0000000000f23985",
      "text": "  `[-* [🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥.icon]]`",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790904922,
      "updated": 1790911975
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf0c450000000000f23998",
      "text": "  目が回ったり気が散ったりする方がいたら、勝手に止めてもらってOKです",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790905413,
      "updated": 1790911975
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf11ae0000000000cc994e",
      "text": "  風車みたい[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790906799,
      "updated": 1790911975
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf124f00000000007c6c64",
      "text": " 　ずっと見てられる[Fukazuuu.icon]",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790906960,
      "updated": 1790911975
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf524500000000001f797d",
      "text": " 　あ、そうか、何か変だなと感じたのは、棒の支点の位置が端っこじゃない点だったのか！",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790923334,
      "updated": 1790923395
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf529300000000001f797f",
      "text": "  　[-* [🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　.icon]]",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790923412,
      "updated": 1790924619
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf529500000000001f7980",
      "text": "  　`[-* [🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　.icon]]`",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790923414,
      "updated": 1790924644
    },
    {
      "id": "6abfcadb0000000000142a88",
      "text": "  　真ん中支点のものもあったような気がする[yosider.icon][{ アツっ]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790954202,
      "updated": 1790954243
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf56be00000000001f7983",
      "text": " 　[-* ああああああ[KNo.804C.icon][KNo.804C.icon][KNo.804C.icon*2][KNo.804C.icon*4]]",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790924479,
      "updated": 1790924686
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf570c00000000001f7984",
      "text": "  　存在するアイコンの連なりはやはり例外扱いされない（仕様通りの振る舞いになる）か",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790924557,
      "updated": 1790924742
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf253c0000000000bc370f",
      "text": " マリオの4コマ劇場だったと思うが、以下の4コマが印象に残っている",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790911805,
      "updated": 1790923418
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf46f00000000000425d53",
      "text": "  1. クッパ「ねぇ、何食べてるの？」マリオ「クッパ」",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790920433,
      "updated": 1790920560
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf47060000000000425d55",
      "text": "  2. クッパ「へ、へぇ……」マリオ「……」",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790920455,
      "updated": 1790920562
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf472d0000000000425d57",
      "text": "  3. クッパ「お、おいしそうだね……？」マリオ「別に」",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790920493,
      "updated": 1790920567
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf47480000000000425d59",
      "text": "  4. クッパ「（涙）」マリオ「（お椀の中身を無言でたいらげる）」",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790920520,
      "updated": 1790920614
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf46c10000000000425d52",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1790920386,
      "updated": 1790920386
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf124f00000000007c6c65",
      "text": "[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790906960,
      "updated": 1790907063
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf12b700000000007c6c67",
      "text": " [Battle of Pride 2026]を配信で見る予定",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790907064,
      "updated": 1790907081
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf6371000000000077f16b",
      "text": "  現地に行けないというのは切ないものだ",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790927730,
      "updated": 1790927739
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf6bac00000000005a324c",
      "text": "   もともと行く気だったのだが、身重の妻を置いては行けない",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790929837,
      "updated": 1790929862
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf637a000000000077f16c",
      "text": "  この2年間、[ヒプステ]には随分と夢を見せてもらった",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790927739,
      "updated": 1790954319
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf639f000000000077f16d",
      "text": "   舞台オリジナルキャラの2周目まで見せてもらえたことには感謝しかない",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790927776,
      "updated": 1790928098
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf65e5000000000077f176",
      "text": "    本来のプランなら[Battle of Pride 2023]の時点で未来が途絶えていたはずだ",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790928362,
      "updated": 1790928436
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf64e5000000000077f172",
      "text": "   丁寧に扱ってもらえて本当にありがたかった",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790928102,
      "updated": 1790928195
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf653f000000000077f173",
      "text": "   が、[キャラが増えすぎ]である",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790928192,
      "updated": 1790954368
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf658f000000000077f175",
      "text": "    原作キャラよりも人数が多くなってしまった",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790928273,
      "updated": 1790928324
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf646a000000000077f170",
      "text": "   side中王区は明らかに続編を想定しているので置いておいて、男達はそろそろ本当に居なくなってしまうかもしれない",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790927979,
      "updated": 1790928626
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf649e000000000077f171",
      "text": "    もう解放してあげるべきだと思う反面、淋しい気持ちも抑えられない",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790928031,
      "updated": 1790928054
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf6663000000000077f17f",
      "text": "    初代カンパニーの頃は彼らに次の出番があるかどうかもわからない状況だったわけだ……",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790928485,
      "updated": 1790928485
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf6663000000000077f180",
      "text": "    それと比べると2025年以降の状況は随分と恵まれていた",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790928485,
      "updated": 1790928524
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf668c000000000077f181",
      "text": "     あって当然という認知になってきてしまっているかもしれない、よくない",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790928525,
      "updated": 1790928561
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf66d4000000000077f182",
      "text": "   卒業のときはちゃんと卒業と銘打ってほしいけど、これも求め過ぎの[オタク仕草]だよなあ。無言で去っていくことだってあるし。",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790928597,
      "updated": 1790954357
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf6ad200000000005a3249",
      "text": "   [石川凌雅]の一郎は今回で卒業",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790929619,
      "updated": 1790929635
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf6ae500000000005a324a",
      "text": "    フレッシュで可愛かったな。[高野洸]の一郎よりも原作に近い雰囲気だった",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790929638,
      "updated": 1790929739
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf6b0a00000000005a324b",
      "text": "    プレッシャーも凄かったろうが、とにかくお疲れ様と思う",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790929675,
      "updated": 1790929787
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf6720000000000077f184",
      "text": "  これまでも全体ライブを通して様々な別れがあったから、ナイーブになってしまっている🥲",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790928673,
      "updated": 1790929588
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf6ab300000000005a3248",
      "text": "   まあ次回作の話も出るだろうからそれを楽しみにしよう",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790929588,
      "updated": 1790929613
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf92d50000000000f4cdc8",
      "text": "    えっ次回作発表無し！？！？！？ 初めてのパターンで動揺してる",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790939862,
      "updated": 1790939881
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf6bcf00000000005a324d",
      "text": "   アカバネとまた会えますように",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790929872,
      "updated": 1790929878
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf895900000000003c380c",
      "text": "  全景助かる",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790937434,
      "updated": 1790937445
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf8db300000000000769a8",
      "text": "   スイッチングより照明が見れて嬉しい",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790938549,
      "updated": 1790938564
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf8d0300000000000769a7",
      "text": "  はぁ 掛け値無しに良いライブだ",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790938372,
      "updated": 1790938389
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf92d10000000000f4cdc7",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790939859,
      "updated": 1790939860
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf66d7000000000077f183",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1790928600,
      "updated": 1790928600
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf1b0000000000002977ac",
      "text": "[koyoshi.icon]",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1790909185,
      "updated": 1790909186
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf1b0200000000002977ad",
      "text": " Gyazo経由で貼った画像に、自宅や職場の位置情報が残っているものがあったので、削除して差し替えた",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1790909187,
      "updated": 1790909302
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf1b0700000000002977af",
      "text": "  一部は井戸端に貼ったものもあった💦",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1790909192,
      "updated": 1790909192
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf1b5100000000002977b1",
      "text": "  無料ユーザーだと便利な検索（位置情報の有無とか）が使えないから、力技で対応w",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1790909265,
      "updated": 1790909352
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf6ef30000000000caff8b",
      "text": "  一括ダウンロード機能のこともあるし、どこかのタイミングで課金するかな？",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1790930675,
      "updated": 1790930706
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf1d220000000000674b31",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1790909730,
      "updated": 1790909730
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf1d220000000000674b32",
      "text": "[terang.icon]",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1790909730,
      "updated": 1790909731
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf1d230000000000674b33",
      "text": "\t金曜日か",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1790909731,
      "updated": 1790909734
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf1b0600000000002977ae",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1790909190,
      "updated": 1790909190
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf21f50000000000b399c8",
      "text": "[taktamur.icon]",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1790910965,
      "updated": 1790910967
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf21f80000000000b399c9",
      "text": " 帰ったら俺、[AceCombat8]をやるんだ",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1790910968,
      "updated": 1790910988
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf2a2e0000000000ab0d7a",
      "text": " \t[Metoo][Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1790913070,
      "updated": 1790913081
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf4848000000000094d833",
      "text": " \t同じくです。楽しみましょうねー[d.icon]",
      "userId": "6a2babc59ed01ef66961784c",
      "created": 1790920775,
      "updated": 1790920786
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf3588000000000021989f",
      "text": " ChatGPTアプリのRemoteがなくなった？と思ったけど、Codex枠の中に吸収されてた",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1790915976,
      "updated": 1790916012
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf35ad00000000002198a0",
      "text": " ",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1790916013,
      "updated": 1790916013
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf22220000000000b399ca",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1790911010,
      "updated": 1790911011
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf3524000000000096eade",
      "text": "[caki.icon]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1790915879,
      "updated": 1790915881
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf3527000000000096eadf",
      "text": " 鍋を食べたいという強い気持ち",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1790915881,
      "updated": 1790915890
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf3598000000000096eae1",
      "text": " 脳内をクッパ城のBGMが行き交う",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1790915994,
      "updated": 1790916016
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf38d10000000000ab0d7d",
      "text": " \tクッパ（料理）は鍋なのかどうかという議論が脳内で発生したが鍋ではないと速やかに収束[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1790916818,
      "updated": 1790916857
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf3e6000000000006eabd3",
      "text": " \t クッパもおいし〜い[caki.icon]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1790918243,
      "updated": 1790918252
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf3e6a00000000006eabd4",
      "text": " 月末U-NEXTを解約するのを忘れたのでポイント使って映画でも見に行くかーの気持ちになっている",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1790918253,
      "updated": 1790918305
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf3e9f00000000006eabd5",
      "text": "  AI、月末にサブスク解約してくれないかな",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1790918305,
      "updated": 1790918328
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf53cc000000000042c8e6",
      "text": "   なんかそなかんじのサービスあった気がする[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1790923729,
      "updated": 1790923735
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf3eb500000000006eabd6",
      "text": " 音沙汰がなかった中国の友人から手紙が届いた",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1790918328,
      "updated": 1790918347
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf3ec900000000006eabd7",
      "text": "  届くのにかかる時間が昨年は[1ヶ月]弱だったが今は[1.5ヶ月]強ほどになっている",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1790918348,
      "updated": 1790959115
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf3f0200000000006eabd8",
      "text": "   一応届くので好（ハオ）",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1790918405,
      "updated": 1790918421
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf3f2600000000006eabd9",
      "text": "  3〜4ヶ月前位に書いた手紙の話をされるのでなんだっけそれ、となる",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1790918441,
      "updated": 1790918479
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf4894000000000094d834",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6a2babc59ed01ef66961784c",
      "created": 1790920850,
      "updated": 1790920850
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf4894000000000094d835",
      "text": "[d.icon]",
      "userId": "6a2babc59ed01ef66961784c",
      "created": 1790920850,
      "updated": 1790920852
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf4896000000000094d836",
      "text": "　gyazoのあれこれで画像が表示されなくなってるのか。",
      "userId": "6a2babc59ed01ef66961784c",
      "created": 1790920852,
      "updated": 1790920865
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf48a3000000000094d837",
      "text": "　",
      "userId": "6a2babc59ed01ef66961784c",
      "created": 1790920865,
      "updated": 1790920865
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf352f000000000096eae0",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1790915890,
      "updated": 1790915890
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf5dad00000000002d8b88",
      "text": "[inajob.icon]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1790926254,
      "updated": 1790926255
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf5dae00000000002d8b8a",
      "text": "\t無料で使えるコーディング用LLM",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1790926255,
      "updated": 1790926364
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf5db700000000002d8b8b",
      "text": "\t\t[OpenCode Zen]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1790926264,
      "updated": 1790926269
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf5dbd00000000002d8b8c",
      "text": "\t\t\t[Muse Spark 1.3] が賢い",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1790926270,
      "updated": 1790926373
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf88740000000000acf70b",
      "text": "\t\t\t Muse使ってみたいけど、データが学習に使われるから、研究には使いづらい[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1790937204,
      "updated": 1790937229
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf5df700000000002d8b91",
      "text": "\t\t\t[Big Pickle]も賢いがステルスモデルなので中身がちょいちょい変わってる？",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1790926328,
      "updated": 1790926345
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf5dcc00000000002d8b8d",
      "text": "\t\t[OpenRouter]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1790926285,
      "updated": 1790926288
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf5dd000000000002d8b8e",
      "text": "\t\t\t[Nemotron 3 Ultra] がまぁ賢い",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1790926289,
      "updated": 1790926378
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf687000000000002d8b92",
      "text": "\t\t\t\tやっぱ賢くない",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1790929009,
      "updated": 1790929012
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf5dde00000000002d8b8f",
      "text": "\t\t\t\t[Muse Spark 1.3]の方が賢い感じがする",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1790926303,
      "updated": 1790926382
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf5dea00000000002d8b90",
      "text": "\t\t\t\tコンテキストが大きいのはうれしい",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1790926315,
      "updated": 1790926322
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf5dad00000000002d8b89",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1790926254,
      "updated": 1790926254
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf64da0000000000c6ccea",
      "text": "[h45te.icon]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1790928092,
      "updated": 1790928094
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf64de0000000000c6ccec",
      "text": " 友人に「会話の本質って空気の振動を通じて（自分の頭の中の）関連する情報を活性化させてその連鎖で相互作用を起こす作業じゃね？」と言ったら「会話はキャッチボールです。お前は周りを考えて喋れ」と正論で返された",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1790928096,
      "updated": 1790959131
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf65830000000000c6cced",
      "text": "  一般的に関連が極めて薄い事柄を投げまくってる自覚はあるので精進します",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1790928261,
      "updated": 1790928388
    },
    {
      "id": "6abfde1f00000000000ecef0",
      "text": "  #会話のキャッチボール",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1790959135,
      "updated": 1790959142
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf671c00000000002adee3",
      "text": " 元カノとの思い出を歌詞にしてる",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1790928670,
      "updated": 1790928713
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf674800000000002adee4",
      "text": "  3年は経ってるので多分時効",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1790928713,
      "updated": 1790928732
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf676800000000002adee5",
      "text": " [初恋は実らない]ってどこまで本当なんだろ",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790928746,
      "updated": 1790954684
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf64da0000000000c6cceb",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1790928092,
      "updated": 1790928092
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf7dc50000000000159378",
      "text": "[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1790934471,
      "updated": 1790934472
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf7dc60000000000159379",
      "text": "\tクラウドソーシングアカウントは結構盲点だよなぁ",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1790934472,
      "updated": 1790934484
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf7dd2000000000015937b",
      "text": "\t\t他のアカウントやSNS投稿含めて警戒してそうな人でも顔が出てたりする",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1790934484,
      "updated": 1790934522
    },
    {
      "id": "6abf7dc6000000000015937a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1790934472,
      "updated": 1790934472
    },
    {
